    "Also hide when a window covers everything below the menu bar, like a maximized video player. True fullscreen apps always hide the dock. Not used while Avoid Dock Overlap is on, since that resizes the window instead." : {
      "comment" : "Settings control description",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
