            "value" : "DockDoor Pro không ghi lại video hoặc gửi ảnh chụp màn hình đi bất cứ đâu. Nếu không có quyền này, bản xem trước có thể phải chuyển về hiển thị các hàng văn bản thu gọn."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro 不会录制视频，也不会将屏幕截图发送到任何地方。没有此权限时，预览将回退为仅显示文本的紧凑列表。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro 不會錄製畫面，也不會將螢幕截圖傳送至任何地方。若未啟用此功能，預覽可能會改以精簡的純文字列顯示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DockDoor Pro has no telemetry, analytics, or behavior tracking. Window and app state stays on your Mac. Location is only used for WeatherKit when you enable local weather. Network access is used for activation checks, updates, and features you choose to use such as WeatherKit and lyrics lookup." : {
      "comment" : "Privacy onboarding note",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro has no telemetry, analytics, or behavior tracking. Window and app state stays on your Mac. Location is only used for WeatherKit when you enable local weather. Network access is used for activation checks, updates, and features you choose to use such as WeatherKit and lyrics lookup."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro ليس لديه قياسات عن بعد أو تحليلات أو تتبع سلوك. النافذة وحالة التطبيق تبقى على ماك الخاص بك. الموقع يستخدم فقط لـ WeatherKit عند تمكين الطقس المحلي. يتم استخدام الوصول إلى الشبكة للتحقق من التنشيط والتحديثات والميزات التي تختار استخدامها مثل WeatherKit والبحث عن كلمات الأغنية."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro has no telemetry, analytics, or behavior tracking. Window and app state stays on your Mac. Location is only used for WeatherKit when you enable local weather. Network access is used for activation checks, updates, and features you choose to use such as WeatherKit and lyrics lookup."
          }
        },
