        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用于触发 Alt-Tab 窗口切换器、字母导航以及基于起始键的 Dock 快捷键的修饰键。由于 macOS 保留了 Command-Tab，快捷键设置项无法直接录制 ⌘-Tab；当前 Command-Tab 仍保持系统默认功能。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用於觸發 Alt-Tab 視窗切換器、字母導覽及 Dock 快速鍵的共用修飾鍵。目前 Command-Tab 已啟用；由於 macOS 保留此組合鍵，因此下方的快速鍵欄位無法直接錄製 ⌘-Tab。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The modifier that triggers the Alt-Tab window switcher, letter navigation, and initializer-based dock shortcuts. Set it to Command to switch with ⌘-Tab instead of %@-Tab; the shortcut fields below can't record ⌘-Tab directly because macOS reserves it." : {
      "comment" : "Settings control description",
