            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schakel AppSense in en koppel vervolgens een profiel aan een app. Zolang die app actief is, kan DockDoor Pro dat profiel op alle beeldschermen toepassen, waarbij de instellingen per beeldscherm worden overschreven, totdat je naar een andere app overschakelt."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Włącz AppSense, a następnie powiąż profil z aplikacją. Gdy aplikacja jest aktywna, DockDoor Pro może zastosować ten profil na wszystkich wyświetlaczach, zastępując ich osobne przypisania do czasu przełączenia na inną aplikację."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Включите AppSense, затем свяжите профиль с приложением. Пока это приложение находится на переднем плане, DockDoor Pro может применять связанный профиль на всех дисплеях, временно переопределяя назначения для отдельных дисплеев. После перехода к другому приложению прежние назначения снова начнут действовать.\n"
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bật AppSense, sau đó liên kết một hồ sơ với một ứng dụng. Khi ứng dụng đó được tập trung, DockDoor Pro có thể áp dụng hồ sơ đó trên các màn hình, ghi đè các thiết lập riêng cho từng màn hình cho đến khi bạn chuyển sang ứng dụng khác."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启用 AppSense，然后将配置文件关联到一个应用。当该应用获得焦点时，DockDoor Pro 会在所有显示器上应用该配置文件，并在切换到其他应用之前覆盖按显示器分配的配置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "啟用 AppSense，然後將設定檔連結至應用程式。當該應用程式取得焦點時，DockDoor Pro 會在所有顯示器上套用該設定檔，並暫時覆蓋各顯示器的個別指派設定，直到您切換至其他應用程式為止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
