    "Turn the dock on or off per display, and give each its own edge and profile. \"Use Global\" follows the orientation above; \"Active Profile\" follows whichever profile you switch to." : {
      "comment" : "Per-display configuration note",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
