            "value" : "With the menu bar icon off, you can still reopen Settings from the dock's profile or settings button — or by relaunching DockDoor Pro from Finder, Spotlight, or Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With the menu bar icon off, you can still reopen Settings from the dock's profile or settings button — or by relaunching DockDoor Pro from Finder, Spotlight, or Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "С выключенной иконкой в строке меню вы всё ещё можете открыть настройки через кнопку профиля или настроек в доке — или перезапустив DockDoor Pro из Finder, Spotlight или Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With the menu bar icon off, you can still reopen Settings from the dock's profile or settings button — or by relaunching DockDoor Pro from Finder, Spotlight, or Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With the menu bar icon off, you can still reopen Settings from the dock's profile or settings button — or by relaunching DockDoor Pro from Finder, Spotlight, or Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With the menu bar icon off, you can still reopen Settings from the dock's profile or settings button — or by relaunching DockDoor Pro from Finder, Spotlight, or Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With the menu bar icon off, you can still reopen Settings from the dock's profile or settings button — or by relaunching DockDoor Pro from Finder, Spotlight, or Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Khi biểu tượng thanh menu tắt, bạn vẫn có thể mở lại phần Cài đặt từ nút hồ sơ hoặc nút cài đặt của dock — hoặc bằng cách chạy lại DockDoor Pro từ Finder, Spotlight hoặc Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "即使关闭菜单栏图标，仍可通过 Dock 中的配置文件按钮或设置按钮重新打开“设置”；也可以通过访达、Spotlight 或启动台重新启动 DockDoor Pro。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
